=2999b8","album":[],"album_video":[],"location_slug":"","views":4842251,"location_id":""}},{"date":1722470400000,"post":{"id":null,"tiktok_post_id":null,"url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/C-3ravHSn1f","post_user_id":"5a3ef4dfedc2956dd5bb5f4b","channel":"instagram","author":"vindiesel","created_at":"2024-08-19T23:29:32","title":"Forever…","image_url":"https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/crawler.img/66ce842083343823198fdf61.jpg","avatar":"https://instagram.fvno7-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.2885-19/82920451_2831151230281357_9147763080388673536_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e0_s150x150&_nc_ht=instagram.fvno7-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=1&_nc_ohc=MU3JSGV3DBMQ7kNvgEBo9EZ&_nc_gid=8e41ba9d7c62414bab9ba39441f749d2&edm=AEF8tYYBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AYCydwOssrpgxZXlTOQKvolQo9tle0MKMcjrXFvng1hBaA&oe=670986F3&_nc_sid=1e20d2","content":null,"likes":2019622,"comments":6161,"clean":true,"last_update_time":"2024-10-12T02:37:38.323827","followers":102848480,"max_price":476305,"min_price":471623,"location_name":"","location_public":false,"is_video":false,"album":[],"album_video":[],"location_slug":"","location_id":""}},{"date":1725148800000,"post":{"id":null,"tiktok_post_id":null,"url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/C_1XwhBSKJO","post_user_id":"5a3ef4dfedc2956dd5bb5f4b","channel":"instagram","author":"vindiesel","created_at":"2024-09-12T22:30:39","title":"Looking back, a quarter century ago… I believe this was the moment we knew that our brotherhood was going to change Hollywood, that you and I meant something to the world… a multicultural brotherhood, bond not by blood, but by love…\n\nTo think I just saw concept art for the next chapter. Brian… yeah, I will have to brace myself for this next film…\n\nI saw your mother and Father this summer. I could feel you in their loving embrace… for the last 11 years I have held words like talismans of light, each have gifted me so much with their love and wisdom. \n\nAnd your daughter… my God, she’s actually continuing your good works, speaking on behalf of our oceans. Just weeks ago, at a birthday dinner… Meadow gave a toast, man you would have been so damn proud. She has a way of speaking from her heart that echos the melody of grace so beautifully. \n\nTraveling to the corners of the world…  there’s always someone there to remind me of the impact we’ve had on their lives. Either showing their cars with pride, haha… or simply saying, they feel like they were raised by us. That beautiful brotherhood, a quarter century old. \n\nA brotherhood, timeless and bond by love. For that I am eternally grateful… but damn, I miss you Pablo. \n\nHappy birthday…","image_url":"https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/crawler.img/66fa02ff69ee48dbdbefe3d0.jpg","avatar":"https://instagram.fdub3-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.2885-19/82920451_2831151230281357_9147763080388673536_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e0_s150x150&_nc_ht=instagram.fdub3-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=1&_nc_ohc=3ru4HbfWPT0Q7kNvgGYuVzj&_nc_gid=de57414b5bf74ae3837db77e842dc2a1&edm=AEF8tYYBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AYDUhCE_k8Wvf5joLXaPr8kdQ0vCKySqgq9EfldNk9qg3w&oe=6717CF33&_nc_sid=1e20d2","content":null,"likes":2375068,"comments":17022,"clean":true,"last_update_time":"2024-11-03T09:07:34.358097","followers":102809072,"max_price":476079,"min_price":471396,"location_name":"","location_public":false,"is_video":false,"album":[],"album_video":[],"location_slug":"","location_id":""}},{"date":1727740800000,"post":{"id":null,"tiktok_post_id":null,"url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/DBpymwmRyk-","post_user_id":"5a3ef4dfedc2956dd5bb5f4b","channel":"instagram","author":"vindiesel","created_at":"2024-10-28T03:37:09","title":"Weekend script work with the Riddick Director…\n\nHappy creative…","image_url":"https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/crawler.img/67212576f6d285d1926b5bf8.jpg","avatar":"https://instagram.fdub3-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.2885-19/82920451_2831151230281357_9147763080388673536_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e0_s150x150&_nc_ht=instagram.fdub3-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=1&_nc_ohc=3ru4HbfWPT0Q7kNvgGYuVzj&_nc_gid=de57414b5bf74ae3837db77e842dc2a